Mod Kepp Hock Legacy — Installation

Requirements

- Grand Theft Auto V Legacy
- Windows 10 / 11
- ReShade compatible with the game

Installation

1. Install ReShade from the official website: https://reshade.me/
2. Select the GTA V Legacy game executable.
3. Select the graphics API detected for your installation.
4. Install the shader effects required by the preset:
   - Vibrance
   - Tonemap
   - Curves
5. Copy "KeppHockLegacy.ini" into the game's ReShade preset folder.
6. Open ReShade in Story Mode and select "KeppHockLegacy.ini".
7. Enable the available effects and check the result.

Important

- This preset is intended for Story Mode only.
- Do not use it in GTA Online.
- The preset has not been tested on every PC configuration.